Package: popgen
Type: Package
Title: Population Genetics Simulations for the Bio 113 Website
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Bio 113 team", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: One-locus, two-allele population genetics: Hardy-Weinberg,
    genetic drift (Wright-Fisher), selection, mutation, migration, inbreeding
    and bottlenecks. The same R code runs in RStudio and, via webR, in the
    browser on the course website.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
